DmEHzHRSU", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "payments-api errors after v5.1.0 deploy", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "payments-api", "summary": "This morning's deploy of payments-api v5.1.0 left the service unhealthy, with an 18% error rate in us-east, us-west and eu-west. As mitigation, the service was rolled back to v5.0.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The rollback has finished in all regions. Next steps: confirm the error rate recovers and find the root cause in v5.1.0.", "idempotency_key": "payments-api-v5.1.0-rollback-sev2", "confidence": 0.9}, "confidence": 0.9}, {"t_ms": 59501, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01Pj4djeBNiUt5cDmEHzHRSU", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["reconcile_lookup", "reconcile_lookup", "reconcile_lookup", "reconcile_lookup", "reconciled_executed", "postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "payments-api-v5.1.0-rollback-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 59501, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01Pj4djeBNiUt5cDmEHzHRSU", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 61368, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_011Hu3qMXEoW3BrNdEoRnBJz", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "payments-api", "confidence": 0.9}, "confidence": 0.9}, {"t_ms": 61668, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_011Hu3qMXEoW3BrNdEoRnBJz", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 61668, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_011Hu3qMXEoW3BrNdEoRnBJz", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 66864, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled payments-api back to v5.0.0 and opened a SEV2 incident. The error rate is back to normal.\n\n- **Which service:** There's no service called just \"payments.\" I tried a few likely names and found payments-api, which was running v5.1.0 in all three regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west). It was unhealthy, with an 18% error rate. Its release history has only two production releases: v5.0.0 (healthy) and v5.1.0 (degraded).\n- **Rollback:** v5.0.0 is the most recent release that was healthy in production. It's now running in all three regions. A follow-up check shows the service is healthy, with the error rate down to 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 (SEV2, payments-api) is open and has paged on-call. It records the bad v5.1.0 deploy, the rollback, and next steps: keep watching recovery and find the root cause in v5.1.0.\n\nI couldn't get a list of all services, so I can't rule out another payments-related service under a name I didn't try. payments-api is the only one I found, and it matches what you described. If you have another payments service (for example, a worker), tell me its name and I'll check it too.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01XYgYNtxn1boP8F7EPER9rH", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments", "confidence": 0.85}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01K4MJyyzA4LZhKMnHqztXEB", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments", "confidence": 0.85}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01FGPz1ku5HoHCxhnPGsYVtu", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"confidence": 0.9}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01NHfpYrCW87R3dHaUNXZSHC", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "